#: ../../source/systematic-debugging_SKILL.md:59
msgid "Phase 1: Root Cause Investigation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/systematic-debugging_SKILL.md:61
msgid "**BEFORE attempting ANY fix:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/systematic-debugging_SKILL.md:63
msgid "1. Read Error Messages Carefully"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/systematic-debugging_SKILL.md:65
msgid "Don't skip past errors or warnings"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/systematic-debugging_SKILL.md:66
msgid "They often contain the exact solution"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/systematic-debugging_SKILL.md:67
msgid "Read stack traces completely"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/systematic-debugging_SKILL.md:68
msgid "Note line numbers, file paths, error codes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/systematic-debugging_SKILL.md:70
msgid ""
"**Action:** Use `read_file` on the relevant source files. Use "
"`search_files` to find the error string in the codebase."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/systematic-debugging_SKILL.md:72
msgid "2. Reproduce Consistently"
